	(text "Simulated design only: nothing built in hardware.\nB0 = GND = negative end of the 4S stack. Charge current flows B0 -> RS1 -> N_SH.\nDifference amplifiers: Vout = 0.5 x (B(n) - B(n-1)); 2M / 1M networks matched to 0.01 %\n(sim/ngspice/cell_sense.cir: worst case 4.5 mV; 0.1 % parts give 37.7 mV).\nVAMP (amplifier supply and FET gate drive) is always on in this sheet: 4 mA from the stack.\nQ1 discharge / Q2 charge FETs are common-drain (MID); each body diode passes the other direction.\nISENSE = 1.65 V + 20 mV/A (charge positive). TSn: 10k pull-up, 10k B3950 NTC to GND.\nJ3 goes to an ESP32-S3: VCELL1-4, ISENSE, TS1-4 on ADC1 (GPIO1-9), BAL1-4 GPIO11-14,\nCHG_EN GPIO15, DSG_EN GPIO16."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dfb0c780-1d00-514e-b5ed-9f5a54eca85e")
	)
